    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "a5B2c",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2700,
      "name": "Prototype / handoff",
      "width": 720,
      "height": 260,
      "content": "Main flow: Splash -> Year -> Month detail -> Settings -> Import -> validate -> confirm -> success or error.\n\nInteractions:\n- On the Year screen, tapping a month opens that month detail screen.\n- On the Month detail screen, tapping a date shows contextual day info: workday, weekend, holiday, or shortened workday.\n- Settings include language selection: Russian / English.\n\nAndroid portrait 390x844."
    },
